   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everybody,<div><br></div><div>in STAN is it wise to use:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">  y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> student_t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">((</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">));</span></div></code></div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div> instead of:<br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">  y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> student_t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><font color=\"#006666\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mu</span></font><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>maybe we should additionally MATT trick?</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">((</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> student_t</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span></font><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>Andre</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
